      en: ["Built in the 1950s by Belgian authorities", "Features two long aircraft runways", "Strategic NATO airbase during the Cold War", "Key site for UN operations in the 1960s", "Located in the Haut-Lomami Province", "Primary training center for Congolese forces"],
